  "readmeFile": "README.NuGet.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.10.0. New: completes the documented v2 purchase-journal, purchase-order, sales-order, sales-quote, and recurring-sale areas, including purchase-order head/line mutations, customer-specific sales reads, attachment uploads, and sales-order invoice conversion. Improvements: exposes the complete purchase query-filter surface and adds a netstandard2.0 asset so .NET Framework 4.8 and other compatible applications can use the typed client alongside net10.0. Fixes: preserves null response values for company status, webhook flags, and table counts. Breaking: CompanyStatus.Enabled and all 17 WebhookOptions flags are now bool?; consumers must recompile and handle null.",
